//          (`if(fNote->bMyServoOffOutShuttle1){...}`).  Same single blocker:
//          the ported TfNote has no bMyServoOffOutShuttle1 /
//          iMyServoOffOutShuttle1Pos.  DEFAULT: golden's own else-arm (golden
