//
//  GATE REGISTER
//  -------------
//    H1-01  :19762      fProductionInfo->CalculateOEEPlanOut()
//                       forms/fProductionInfo.h has no such method.  DELTA: the OEE
//                       plan-out figure is not recalculated per index cycle.  No
//                       refusal / interlock / alarm / brake.
