//                       UPH_StringGrid->Cells).  TfObserverShim has no TimeInfoGrid; the
//                       W7C1 fShowBinSelect seam (csystem.cpp:1234) exposes UPH_StringGrid   [AI(W906-FLOW-3) 20260928: superseded -- seam retired (:2490), TfObserverShim retired 20260818; H1-04 lifted at :24209]
//                       as a VALUE member with no `Cells`, so golden's `->Cells` cannot
