                        //  WHAT  : fAirCon->PowerUp(0.5) on the ambient idle branch.
                        //  WHY   : same blocker as H1-09a.
                        //  DELTA : The chiller is not held at its idle level; SW[SwCoolingFan_Blower].Off() beside
