// ===========================================================================
//  AI(W906-MT-E3b) 20260925: Motor Test / Teach "page open" + VerifyMotorAction (EastSun ruling R8 20260925:
//  「VerifyMotorAction = COMPLETELY golden ... AND golden MainProc pauses while Motor Test / Teach is open」).
//
//  (1) fShow.  golden asks `fMotorTest->fShow` / `fTeach->fShow`; in this tree the page is a browser window
//      and the browser owns that fact.  wb_serve already receives it: background.html setWinState() ->
//      pushRegistry() -> `ui.windows.put` (tools/wb_serve.cpp) -> ht9045::WebWindowRegistryPut(), sent on every
//      open / minimise / close plus a 5 s heartbeat (web background.html AI(W906-MT-E3) 20260925).  The
//      answer golden needs is ht9045::WebWindowRegistryFShowPolicy(form) (WebWindowRegistry.h:153-155).
//      That file is compiled only into wb_serve, and this TU is in ht9045_sm, which every ctest links -- so
//      the engine reads it through a hook the wb_serve side registers (NULL here == "page not open", the
//      same answer the policy itself gives when no browser ever reported: Q8-B).  W906_FormFShow() is the
//      union `member || hook`, the same shape as WebStart.cpp's W906_FShow.
//  (2) VerifyMotorAction -- golden uteach.cpp:5345-5426, translated below statement for statement.  Defined
//      here and not in forms/fTeach.cpp (golden's uteach.cpp port) because MainProc is its only caller and
//      that file is outside this change; forms/fTeach.h:830 keeps golden's declaration.  Deviations, each
//      because the golden object it reads does not exist in this tree:
//        * `fTeach` / `fMotorTest` may be NULL here (golden's are always created) -> NULL-guarded.
//        * the browser owns HOME / motion state: W906_MotorHomingHook() is OR-ed into golden's
//          `btnHome->Down` test, and W906_MotorMovingHook(i) answers for the motors it claims (the 1203 axes:
//          golden's MOT[i].Motor->MotionDone() cannot reach an axis the 1203 monitor opened; for a
//          TMyEtherCatMotor it always returns false here, i.e. it would read "moving" forever).  A claimed
//          motor is decided by the hook BEFORE golden's INDEX_MOTION_CARD==0 Galil branch -- EastSun ruling R2
//          20260925: a Mot_Table row whose CardModel is PCI1203 (M14 MTestZ1 on HT9050) is a 1203 axis.
//        * `fTeach->labLock` has no member in the facade -> its Visible/Caption go to W906_GetMotorLockState().
//        * golden StopAllMotor() cannot reach the 1203 monitor's axes -> W906_Stop1203AllHook(why) right after.
//        * golden AllBtnUp() raises buttons that the web pages own -> W906_MotorAllBtnUpHook(why) right after
//          the two facade calls (they are still made when the facade objects exist).
//      Everything else -- the 2 s MoveDelay re-armed on every moving pass, the door check only after a lock,
//      bDoorClosed as the return value (so MainProc returns only when a lock ended with the door closed) -- is
//      golden's, including its effects: a LoopMove wait longer than 2 s (cbbLoopWaitTime 3/6 s) is ended by
//      the 2 s idle StopAllMotor + AllBtnUp, exactly as golden does.
// ===========================================================================
void (*W906_Stop1203AllHook)(const char* why)        = 0;
bool (*W906_FormFShowHook)(const char* goldenForm)   = 0;  void (*W906_FormProgramShowHook)(const char* goldenForm, bool open, const char* where) = 0;  const char* (*W906_UiPagesJsonHook)() = 0;  bool (*W906_PageStartAllowedHook)(const char* func) = 0;  unsigned long (*W906_PageStartMarkHook)() = 0;  bool (*W906_PageStartRefusedSinceHook)(unsigned long, bool) = 0;   /*AI(W906-PAGETAB-R144) 20260929: SECS S2F42 HCACK=2（WebPageTable.cpp 檔尾）*/   //AI(W906-PAGETAB-Q51) 20260928 [W906] 頁面表的兩個安裝座（csystem.h:421）：程式開／關畫面（golden fXxx->Show()／Close()，uhome.cpp:646／:652）、ui.pages tag（WebBridgeTags.cpp:1263）；tools/wb_serve.cpp:4389 裝，ctest 是 0 ＝ 不做；接在同一行，不移動行號。AI(W906-PAGETAB-Q51) 20260928 [W906] 第三個安裝座 W906_PageStartAllowedHook：MainProc 的 SoftStart 閘（本檔 :30425；本體 WebPageTable.cpp PageStartAllowed），同樣是 wb_serve 裝、ctest 是 0 ＝ 不擋
bool (*W906_MotorHomingHook)()                       = 0;
int  (*W906_MotorMovingHook)(int motorIndex)         = 0;
void (*W906_MotorAllBtnUpHook)(const char* why)      = 0;
bool (*W906_BrakeServoOnHook)(const char* group, AnsiString* why) = 0;   void (*W906_BrakeVerdictNote)(const char* line) = 0;  bool (*W906_BrakeMotionReadyHook)(AnsiString* why) = 0;   //AI(W906-MT-FIX1) 20260926: see csystem.h  AI(W906-BRAKE-VERDICT) 20261003: + the verdict note hook (csystem.h)

